{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten seconds left on the clock. You have the ball. A fire breathing wyvern attacks \u2013 but you dodge just in time, thanks to a teammate\u2019s spell. A giant worm appears, ready to crush you under its massive weight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just another day in Field of Heroes \u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/901a4ef53ed44c988535004845799538.poster.avif?t=1762916719\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/901a4ef53ed44c988535004845799538.webm?t=1762916719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/901a4ef53ed44c988535004845799538.mp4?t=1762916719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from Pigskin <i>621 A.D.</i>, <i>Rocket League</i>, and <i>Mario Strikers</i>, <i>Field of Heroes</i> is a real-time online spectacle that mixes competitive sports and visceral combat \u2013 but with orcs. A LOT of orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of nine unique warriors, compete online, create your own fields, and seek glory with built-in Twitch integration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to step onto the <i>Field of Heroes</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/8569ee55ea230d754c119a03ddaf20bc.poster.avif?t=1762916719\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/8569ee55ea230d754c119a03ddaf20bc.webm?t=1762916719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/8569ee55ea230d754c119a03ddaf20bc.mp4?t=1762916719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your hero:</i> Play as one of nine unique warriors, each with a unique backstory and skill set.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Compete Anywhere:</i> In online 5v5 PvPvE matches or single player versus AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play your way:</i> Host your own online matches with custom rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Create new fields:</i> Harness the Unreal Engine-powered Editor to add obstacles, monsters, and more \u2013 and share with your friends through Steam Workshop.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gain Notoriety:</i> Track your wins with leaderboards and personal stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Become a Legend:</i> Use Twitch integration to invite your viewers \u2013 they\u2019ll appear as audience members in the stadium who can cheer for you.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1267290?t=1762916719","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1267290?t=1762916719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/c826f21412f1b8ee5606ae5459fb6cde84a51edd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762916719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/c826f21412f1b8ee5606ae5459fb6cde84a51edd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762916719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten seconds left on the clock. You have the ball. A fire breathing wyvern attacks \u2013 but you dodge just in time, thanks to a teammate\u2019s spell. A giant worm appears, ready to crush you under its massive weight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just another day in Field of Heroes \u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/901a4ef53ed44c988535004845799538.poster.avif?t=1762916719\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/901a4ef53ed44c988535004845799538.webm?t=1762916719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/901a4ef53ed44c988535004845799538.mp4?t=1762916719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from Pigskin <i>621 A.D.</i>, <i>Rocket League</i>, and <i>Mario Strikers</i>, <i>Field of Heroes</i> is a real-time online spectacle that mixes competitive sports and visceral combat \u2013 but with orcs. A LOT of orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of nine unique warriors, compete online, create your own fields, and seek glory with built-in Twitch integration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to step onto the <i>Field of Heroes</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/8569ee55ea230d754c119a03ddaf20bc.poster.avif?t=1762916719\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/8569ee55ea230d754c119a03ddaf20bc.webm?t=1762916719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/8569ee55ea230d754c119a03ddaf20bc.mp4?t=1762916719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your hero:</i> Play as one of nine unique warriors, each with a unique backstory and skill set.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Compete Anywhere:</i> In online 5v5 PvPvE matches or single player versus AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play your way:</i> Host your own online matches with custom rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Create new fields:</i> Harness the Unreal Engine-powered Editor to add obstacles, monsters, and more \u2013 and share with your friends through Steam Workshop.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gain Notoriety:</i> Track your wins with leaderboards and personal stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Become a Legend:</i> Use Twitch integration to invite your viewers \u2013 they\u2019ll appear as audience members in the stadium who can cheer for you.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Gamieon, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/2325d0f2b32cb08b1ecdf32d4f2d35f3c5a933b6/header.jpg?t=1762916719","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Field of Heroes\u2122 is a registered trademark of Gamieon, Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum