h_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/5fcb055d9f994415ff8a2b21dfd14c928b731e86/ss_5fcb055d9f994415ff8a2b21dfd14c928b731e86.600x338.jpg?t=1762916719"}],"short_description":"Swords, sorcery \u2013 and soccer. Assemble your orc players in Field of Heroes, the wildest, most radical online sports brawler ever. Conquer existing fields or create your own \u2013 but do it as a team. Sharpen your weapons, focus your spells, and SCORE!","steam_appid":1267290,"support_info":{"email":"support@fieldofheroes.com","url":"https://fieldofheroes.com/contact/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://fieldofheroes.com"}